  "notes": [
    "All listed retain=false; MQTT PUBACK is not application custody.",
    "MQTT5 session/message expiry and in-flight limits depend on verified SKU; application TTL remains required.",
    "Dual MQTT connections use different client IDs where supported; shared CPU/network still measured.",
    "Customer envelope is reference; exact mapping must preserve dedup/correction information."
  ]
